        "description": "You (party:self) and the slots of the profile interview (party:self/<slot>): a slot you answered or corrected is what you said (class said, with the interview's provenance); a slot a model proposed is inferred and never shown as said by you; a slot with no value has no evidence at all and carries a state (unanswered, declined, never) instead.",
