        },
        "description": "The preference.* defaults of the user profile pack (style, length, language, attention needs) through the one scope chain (scope_resolver): the pack's value is the installation level, your override in the profile is the person level, a rule, a unit or the conversation set below it. The evidence follows the level that supplied the value: a preset is declared, a level you set is what you said (observed). attrs.resolved.inheritance carries the whole chain, provenance.scope and its chip say which level set the value.",
